_build/
*.install
.merlin
.commit_msg.txt

# LibreLane/tt_tool.py synthesis scaffold (roadmap item #3) -- tt/ is a
# clone of TinyTapeout/tt-support-tools (regenerate with `git clone
# https://github.com/TinyTapeout/tt-support-tools tt`), runs/ is
# LibreLane's own multi-GB run output, and the src/*.json / src/*.v
# files besides config.json are auto-generated by tt_tool.py or copied
# from the repo-root .v files, not source of truth.
/tt/
/runs/
/src/tt_um_dual.v
/src/config_merged.json
/src/user_config.json

# Regeneratable working output from blackbox_macro_gds.py (see
# docs/design/design_rationale.txt's "KLayout DRC macro-blackbox verification" section) --
# a copy of the signoff GDS with the SRAM macro's internals stripped,
# used ONLY to verify our own design's DRC correctness independent of
# the macro (never the actual tapeout submission GDS), plus its
# KLayout DRC report. Not source of truth, multi-MB, easy to regenerate.
/drc_verify/

.venv-cocotb/
gl_test/sim_build/
gl_test/results.xml
gl_test/*.fst
gl_test/gate_level_netlist.v
__pycache__/

formal/shadow_fifo.v
formal/fifo_prove/
formal/fifo_cover/
